{c}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,T({b}_{2})=2{c}_{2}-{c}_{3}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we write the images of vectors in $B$ relative to the basis $C:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T({b}_{1})={c}_{1}-{c}_{2}+{c}_{3} & \\,⟹\\,[T({b}_{1})]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\ T({b}_{2})=2{c}_{2}-{c}_{3} & \\,⟹\\,[T({b}_{2})]_{C}=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, $[T]_{B|C}$ is the matrix  whose columns are the coordinates of the vectors $T({b}_{1})$ and  $T({b}_{2})$ relative to the basis $C:$\n\n$$\n[T]_{B|C}=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-38528/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a7f1e542-f0a2-54ea-ba7f-0a9928415907"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-38528"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-140430/selection/7325eb4e3707010c0408a3e4ecd5f656d2533ce9ff8bb5d45ec79b81cf46d2a2" :answer/id #uuid "82eb51a0-cd2d-5ea7-b53e-01add5dbfd70" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[T]_{B|C}=[\\begin{aligned}7 & 1 \\\\ -5 & 0 \\\\ 4 & -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140430/selection/c0fdc662233e66ac9975d20f46ba140cbbf681c3f212574cd310b6276eafffe7" :answer/id #uuid "99b8ec31-ae1b-5c00-b85b-257e1424be3d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[T]_{B|C}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140430/selection/5a5da2250b22031ac677a66f1d0e67cc97cdf830b8ad1140d4a9cc29350dcbd5" :answer/id #uuid "0594c0af-6e6c-51aa-9cce-b3e6554aa20f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[T]_{B|C}=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 7 & -6 & -2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-140430/selection/d4614513b024ed8fffd2938b6470c49fb89c08d31350969526bc7cc78bc83d64" :answer/id #uuid "796d939c-7e4b-5245-b0a3-70aa65d6b486" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/